OL,3,GNEWSA'Lovely' former primary school
OL,4,Agoes up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA derelict former school is set to be
OL,7,Fauctioned off this month with a guide
OL,8,Fprice of #350,000.
OL,10,FUpavon Primary School, near Pewsey in
OL,11,FWiltshire, opened in May 1957 and
OL,12,Fclosed for good more than 50 years
OL,13,Flater in February 2009.
OL,15,FThe 5,600 sq ft site, which includes
OL,16,Fplaying fields and a car park, will go
OL,17,Fup for auction on 30 September.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
