OL,3,GNEWSA'Lovely' former primary school
OL,4,Agoes up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinda Ann Bessant, a former dinner lady
OL,7,Fat the school, said "it was lovely" and
OL,8,Fchildren from a nearby RAF base, as
OL,9,Fwell as those in the village, used to
OL,10,Fattend the primary.
